# ============================================================================
# PRIVATE-BY-DEFAULT REPO
#
# This repo publishes ONLY the showcase files explicitly un-ignored below.
# Everything else stays local on purpose:
#   - source/          raw course captures (contain session credentials + JWTs)
#   - pdf/, markdown/, exam-guide/, Study Videos/
#                      Anthropic partner-academy course material (not ours to
#                      redistribute; videos alone are 200+ MB)
#   - udemy/, guide/   the full paid question banks (only 20 samples are public)
#   - notes/           personal study notes
#
# To publish a new file, add a `!/filename` line here — deliberately.
# ============================================================================

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/EXAM-GUIDE.md
!/sample-questions.md
!/quiz.html

# OS junk, everywhere
.DS_Store
